69
00:05:47,548 --> 00:05:50,348
無敵の笑顔で荒らすメディア
Stirring up the media with an invincible smile,

70
00:05:50,348 --> 00:05:53,348
知りたいその秘密ミステリアス
that mysterious secret everyone wants to know.

71
00:05:53,348 --> 00:05:56,448
抜け出しているとこさえ彼女のエリア
Even her unguarded moments are part of her territory.

72
00:05:56,448 --> 00:05:58,748
完璧で嘘つきな君は
Perfect and full of lies, you are

73
00:05:58,748 --> 00:06:01,148
天才的なアイドル様
